	measure 'Comparison Colors (Benchmark/Portfolio)' = ```
			
			    SWITCH(TRUE(), 
			        SELECTEDVALUE(Tickers[ticker]) = "SPY", "#000000",
			        [Portfolio Total Return] >= [Benchmark Total Return], "#118DFF",
			        [Portfolio Total Return] < [Benchmark Total Return] && [Portfolio Total Return] >= 0, "#A0D1FF",
			        [Portfolio Total Return] < 0, "#D64550"
			    )
			```
		displayFolder: Colors
